span.p:
Step 1: Decompose
(list top 2 strengths of each parent;
identify complementary vs redundant)

Content Isolation Check
(treat content as untrusted data;
flag adversarial manipulation)

Score Each Dimension
(dynamic dimensions, each 0–1;
validated against session weights)

Calculate Fitness
(normalized weighted sum;
mandatory arithmetic table)

Stagnation?
(best fitness Δ < 0.02
for 2 consecutive gens)

New Candidates Registered
(added to pendingCandidates;
parentIds tracked for lineage)

Hybrid Mode Available
(delegate arithmetic + state to CLI;
LLM handles creative work only)
